{"seq":1,"slug":"shell-basics","title":"Shell 基础入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/shell-scripting/bash-fundamentals/shell-basics","wordCount":1410,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"shell-基础入门\">Shell 基础入门</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Shell 是用户与操作系统内核之间的命令行接口，它既是一种命令解释器，也是一种功能强大的脚本编程语言。在 Unix/Linux 系统中，Shell 扮演着将用户输入的文本命令翻译为系统调用的核心角色。理解 Shell 的工作机制，是掌握 Linux 系统管理和 DevOps 自动化的第一步。</p>\n<p>现代 Linux 系统中最常见的 Shell 是 Bash（Bourne Again Shell），它继承了 Bourne Shell（sh）的语法，并融合了 C Shell 和 Korn Shell 的诸多优秀特性。除此之外，Zsh、Fish 等新一代 Shell 也在开发者群体中日益流行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户输入命令] --&gt; B[Shell 解释器]&#10;    B --&gt; C{命令类型}&#10;    C --&gt;|内置命令| D[Shell 内部处理]&#10;    C --&gt;|外部命令| E[搜索 PATH]&#10;    E --&gt; F[fork 子进程]&#10;    F --&gt; G[exec 执行程序]&#10;    G --&gt; H[返回退出码]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[Shell 显示结果]\">graph LR\n    A[用户输入命令] --&gt; B[Shell 解释器]\n    B --&gt; C{命令类型}\n    C --&gt;|内置命令| D[Shell 内部处理]\n    C --&gt;|外部命令| E[搜索 PATH]\n    E --&gt; F[fork 子进程]\n    F --&gt; G[exec 执行程序]\n    G --&gt; H[返回退出码]\n    D --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[Shell 显示结果]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Bash</th>\n<th>Zsh</th>\n<th>Fish</th>\n<th>Dash</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>POSIX 兼容</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>大部分</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互式体验</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>优秀</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脚本性能</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>快速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插件生态</td>\n<td>丰富</td>\n<td>非常丰富</td>\n<td>丰富</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认系统 Shell</td>\n<td>多数 Linux</td>\n<td>macOS</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>Debian/Ubuntu</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动补全</td>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>强大</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"shell-的启动与初始化\">Shell 的启动与初始化</h2><p>Shell 的启动过程涉及多个配置文件的加载，理解这一流程对于正确配置环境变量和别名至关重要。Shell 分为 login shell 和 non-login shell 两种模式，它们加载的配置文件不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"login-与-non-login-模式\">login 与 non-login 模式</h3><p>login shell 的启动顺序：首先读取 <code>/etc/profile</code>（系统全局配置），然后按顺序查找用户目录下的 <code>~/.bash_profile</code>、<code>~/.bash_login</code>、<code>~/.profile</code>，找到第一个存在的文件后停止查找。non-login shell（如在终端模拟器中打开新标签页）则只读取 <code>~/.bashrc</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置文件</th>\n<th>加载场景</th>\n<th>适合放置的内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>/etc/profile</code></td>\n<td>login shell，全局</td>\n<td>系统级环境变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>~/.bash_profile</code></td>\n<td>login shell，用户级</td>\n<td>用户环境变量、PATH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>~/.bashrc</code></td>\n<td>non-login 交互式</td>\n<td>别名、提示符、函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>~/.bash_logout</code></td>\n<td>login shell 退出时</td>\n<td>清理临时文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"运行时状态检测\">运行时状态检测</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/bin/bash&#10;&#10;echo &quot;当前 Shell: $SHELL&quot;&#10;echo &quot;Bash 版本: $BASH_VERSION&quot;&#10;echo &quot;进程 ID: $$&quot;&#10;echo &quot;父进程 ID: $PPID&quot;&#10;&#10;if shopt -q login_shell; then&#10;    echo &quot;这是一个 login shell&quot;&#10;else&#10;    echo &quot;这是一个 non-login shell&quot;&#10;fi&#10;&#10;echo &quot;配置文件加载顺序检测:&quot;&#10;echo &quot;HOME=$HOME&quot;&#10;echo &quot;PATH=$PATH&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"当前 Shell: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$SHELL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Bash 版本: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$BASH_VERSION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"进程 ID: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"父进程 ID: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$PPID</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shopt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -q</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login_shell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"这是一个 login shell\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"这是一个 non-login shell\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"配置文件加载顺序检测:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"HOME=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$HOME</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"PATH=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$PATH</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"交互式与非交互式\">交互式与非交互式</h3><p>交互式 Shell 和非交互式 Shell 的区分同样重要。交互式 Shell 等待用户输入命令，而非交互式 Shell 通常用于执行脚本文件。可以通过检查 <code>$-</code> 变量中是否包含 <code>i</code> 标志来判断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"case &quot;$-&quot; in&#10;    *i*) echo &quot;交互式 Shell&quot; ;;&#10;    *)   echo &quot;非交互式 Shell&quot; ;;&#10;esac\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"交互式 Shell\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ;;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    *)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">   echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"非交互式 Shell\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ;;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">esac</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"命令执行机制\">命令执行机制</h2><p>Shell 执行命令时遵循严格的解析和执行流程。首先进行词法分析（将输入拆分为 token），然后判断命令类型，最后执行并收集结果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"命令查找优先级\">命令查找优先级</h3><p>命令查找的优先级顺序为：别名（alias）→ 关键字（如 if、while）→ 函数（function）→ 内置命令（builtin）→ 外部命令（通过 PATH 查找）。可以使用 <code>type</code> 命令来确认一个命令的类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"type cd          # cd is a shell builtin&#10;type ls          # ls is /bin/ls (或 alias)&#10;type if          # if is a shell keyword&#10;type -a echo     # 列出所有匹配的 echo&#10;&#10;which python3    # 只搜索 PATH，不含内置命令&#10;command -v git   # POSIX 标准方式检查命令是否存在\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cd</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # cd is a shell builtin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # ls is /bin/ls (或 alias)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # if is a shell keyword</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> echo</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 列出所有匹配的 echo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">which</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python3</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 只搜索 PATH，不含内置命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">command</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # POSIX 标准方式检查命令是否存在</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"子进程与环境继承\">子进程与环境继承</h3><p>子进程与环境继承是理解 Shell 行为的关键。当 Shell 执行外部命令时，会通过 <code>fork()</code> 创建子进程，子进程继承父进程的环境变量，但不继承局部变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"MY_VAR=&quot;hello&quot;&#10;export MY_ENV=&quot;world&quot;&#10;&#10;bash -c &#39;echo &quot;MY_VAR=$MY_VAR&quot;&#39;   # 输出为空，局部变量不继承&#10;bash -c &#39;echo &quot;MY_ENV=$MY_ENV&quot;&#39;   # 输出 world，环境变量会继承&#10;&#10;(&#10;    echo &quot;子 Shell 中的 PID: $$&quot;&#10;    echo &quot;子 Shell 中的 MY_VAR: $MY_VAR&quot;  # 子 Shell 可以访问&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MY_VAR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MY_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"world\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'echo \"MY_VAR=$MY_VAR\"'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 输出为空，局部变量不继承</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bash</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'echo \"MY_ENV=$MY_ENV\"'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 输出 world，环境变量会继承</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"子 Shell 中的 PID: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"子 Shell 中的 MY_VAR: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$MY_VAR</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 子 Shell 可以访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"管道与重定向\">管道与重定向</h2><p>管道（pipe）和重定向（redirect）是 Shell 最强大的特性之一，它们实现了 Unix 哲学中&quot;组合简单工具完成复杂任务&quot;的理念。</p>\n<h3 id=\"文件描述符与重定向\">文件描述符与重定向</h3><p>标准文件描述符有三个：stdin（0）、stdout（1）、stderr（2）。重定向操作符可以改变这些文件描述符的指向：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作符</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&gt;</code> / <code>&gt;&gt;</code></td>\n<td>覆盖 / 追加重定向 stdout</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>2&gt;</code></td>\n<td>重定向 stderr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;&gt;</code> / <code>2&gt;&amp;1</code></td>\n<td>合并 stdout 与 stderr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;</code></td>\n<td>从文件读入 stdin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;&lt;EOF</code></td>\n<td>here-document 内联输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exec 3&gt;</code></td>\n<td>打开自定义文件描述符</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"ls /valid/path &gt; output.txt 2&gt; error.txt&#10;&#10;ls /valid/path &gt; all.txt 2&gt;&amp;1&#10;&#10;ls /valid/path &amp;&gt; all.txt&#10;&#10;cat &lt;&lt; &#39;EOF&#39; &gt; config.txt&#10;database_host=localhost&#10;database_port=5432&#10;EOF&#10;&#10;read -r line &lt; input.txt&#10;&#10;exec 3&gt; custom.log&#10;echo &quot;写入自定义文件描述符&quot; &gt;&amp;3&#10;exec 3&gt;&amp;-  # 关闭文件描述符 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /valid/path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> output.txt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> error.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /valid/path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> all.txt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 2>&#x26;1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /valid/path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> all.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EOF'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database_host=localhost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database_port=5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">read</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> line</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 3></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> custom.log</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"写入自定义文件描述符\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >&#x26;3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 3>&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 关闭文件描述符 3</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"管道流水线\">管道流水线</h3><p>管道将前一个命令的 stdout 连接到后一个命令的 stdin，形成数据处理流水线。每个管道段都在独立的子进程中运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cat /var/log/syslog | grep &quot;error&quot; | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head -10&#10;&#10;find /project -name &quot;*.ts&quot; | xargs wc -l | sort -n | tail -20&#10;&#10;ps aux | awk &#39;{print $1, $2, $11}&#39; | column -t&#10;&#10;ls -la /tmp | tee /dev/stderr | wc -l&#10;&#10;echo &quot;hello&quot; | { read -r word; echo &quot;got: $word&quot;; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /var/log/syslog</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uniq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /project</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xargs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ps</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aux</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1, $2, $11}'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> column</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -la</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tee</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dev/stderr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">read</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> word</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"got: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$word</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"进程替换\">进程替换</h3><p>进程替换（Process Substitution）是管道的高级形式，它用文件描述符替代临时文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"diff &lt;(ls /dir1) &lt;(ls /dir2)&#10;&#10;while IFS= read -r line; do&#10;    echo &quot;处理: $line&quot;&#10;done &lt; &lt;(find /path -name &quot;*.log&quot;)&#10;&#10;comm -13 &lt;(sort file1.txt) &lt;(sort file2.txt)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">diff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dir1)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /dir2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> IFS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> line</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"处理: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$line</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /path </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.log\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">comm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -13</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file1.txt)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file2.txt)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"通配符与扩展\">通配符与扩展</h2><p>Shell 提供了丰富的扩展机制，在命令执行前对输入进行预处理。理解扩展的顺序和行为对于编写正确的脚本至关重要。</p>\n<h3 id=\"扩展执行顺序\">扩展执行顺序</h3><p>扩展的执行顺序为：花括号扩展 → 波浪号扩展 → 参数和变量扩展 → 命令替换 → 算术扩展 → 词分割 → 路径名扩展（通配符）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"echo {1..5}              # 1 2 3 4 5&#10;echo {a..z}              # a b c ... z&#10;echo file{1,2,3}.txt     # file1.txt file2.txt file3.txt&#10;mkdir -p project/{src,test,docs}/{main,utils}&#10;&#10;echo ~                   # /home/username&#10;echo ~root               # /root&#10;&#10;name=&quot;world&quot;&#10;echo &quot;Hello ${name}&quot;     # Hello world&#10;echo &quot;长度: ${#name}&quot;     # 长度: 5&#10;echo &quot;${name^^}&quot;          # WORLD（转大写）&#10;echo &quot;${name:0:3}&quot;        # wor（子串截取）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {1..5}</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 1 2 3 4 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> {a..z}</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # a b c ... z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file{1,2,3}.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # file1.txt file2.txt file3.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> project/{src,test,docs}/{main,utils}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   # /home/username</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~root</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               # /root</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"world\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Hello ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # Hello world</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"长度: ${</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 长度: 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">^^}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # WORLD（转大写）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # wor（子串截取）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"通配符匹配\">通配符匹配</h3><p>通配符（Globbing）是路径名扩展的核心机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"ls *.md                   # 匹配所有 .md 文件&#10;ls file?.txt              # file1.txt, fileA.txt 等&#10;ls [abc]*.log             # 以 a、b 或 c 开头的 .log 文件&#10;ls [!0-9]*.txt            # 不以数字开头的 .txt 文件&#10;&#10;shopt -s globstar&#10;ls **/*.ts                # 递归匹配所有 .ts 文件&#10;&#10;shopt -s extglob&#10;ls !(*.log|*.tmp)         # 排除 .log 和 .tmp 文件&#10;ls @(*.ts|*.tsx)          # 匹配 .ts 或 .tsx 文件\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.md</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   # 匹配所有 .md 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file?.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # file1.txt, fileA.txt 等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [abc]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.log             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 以 a、b 或 c 开头的 .log 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [!0-9]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.txt            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 不以数字开头的 .txt 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shopt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> globstar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> **</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.ts</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                # 递归匹配所有 .ts 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shopt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> extglob</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tmp)         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 排除 .log 和 .tmp 文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tsx)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 匹配 .ts 或 .tsx 文件</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"命令替换与算术扩展\">命令替换与算术扩展</h3><p>命令替换允许将命令的输出作为另一个命令的参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"current_date=$(date +%Y-%m-%d)&#10;file_count=$(find . -name &quot;*.md&quot; | wc -l)&#10;&#10;echo &quot;项目有 ${file_count} 个 Markdown 文件&quot;&#10;echo &quot;Git 提交数: $(git rev-list --count HEAD)&quot;&#10;&#10;result=$((3 + 5 * 2))&#10;echo &quot;计算结果: $result&quot;&#10;echo &quot;随机数: $((RANDOM % 100))&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">current_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +%Y-%m-%d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">file_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">find</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.md\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"项目有 ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">file_count</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} 个 Markdown 文件\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Git 提交数: $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rev-list </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">--count</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HEAD)\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$((</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"计算结果: </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$result</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"随机数: $((</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RANDOM</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> % </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">))\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><p>理解了机制后，下表的几类基础错误就能在编写阶段主动规避。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误做法</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>别名写进 <code>~/.bash_profile</code></td>\n<td>非交互/non-login 不加载</td>\n<td>别名放 <code>~/.bashrc</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期望子 Shell 修改父变量</td>\n<td>子 Shell 变量不回传</td>\n<td>用进程替换或临时文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cmd &gt; f 2&gt;&amp;1</code> 写成 <code>2&gt;&amp;1 &gt; f</code></td>\n<td>重定向顺序错误 stderr 仍到终端</td>\n<td>先 <code>&gt; f</code> 再 <code>2&gt;&amp;1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通配符无匹配当字面量</td>\n<td>默认返回原模式串</td>\n<td><code>shopt -s nullglob</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管道末段子 Shell 改变量</td>\n<td>变量改动丢失</td>\n<td><code>shopt -s lastpipe</code> 或重构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Shell 是用户与操作系统之间的命令行接口，Bash 是最广泛使用的 Shell 实现</li>\n<li>Shell 分为 login/non-login 和交互式/非交互式四种组合模式，各自加载不同的配置文件</li>\n<li>命令查找遵循 alias → keyword → function → builtin → external 的优先级顺序</li>\n<li>管道将多个命令的 stdin/stdout 串联，实现数据流水线处理</li>\n<li>重定向可改变标准文件描述符（0/1/2）的指向，支持自定义文件描述符</li>\n<li>Shell 扩展按照严格顺序执行：花括号 → 波浪号 → 变量 → 命令替换 → 算术 → 词分割 → 通配符</li>\n<li>进程替换（<code>&lt;(...)</code> 和 <code>&gt;(...)</code>)是管道和临时文件的高级替代方案</li>\n<li>掌握这些基础机制是编写可靠 Shell 脚本的前提</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Shell 基础入门","id":"shell-基础入门"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Shell 的启动与初始化","id":"shell-的启动与初始化"},{"level":3,"text":"login 与 non-login 模式","id":"login-与-non-login-模式"},{"level":3,"text":"运行时状态检测","id":"运行时状态检测"},{"level":3,"text":"交互式与非交互式","id":"交互式与非交互式"},{"level":2,"text":"命令执行机制","id":"命令执行机制"},{"level":3,"text":"命令查找优先级","id":"命令查找优先级"},{"level":3,"text":"子进程与环境继承","id":"子进程与环境继承"},{"level":2,"text":"管道与重定向","id":"管道与重定向"},{"level":3,"text":"文件描述符与重定向","id":"文件描述符与重定向"},{"level":3,"text":"管道流水线","id":"管道流水线"},{"level":3,"text":"进程替换","id":"进程替换"},{"level":2,"text":"通配符与扩展","id":"通配符与扩展"},{"level":3,"text":"扩展执行顺序","id":"扩展执行顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"通配符匹配","id":"通配符匹配"},{"level":3,"text":"命令替换与算术扩展","id":"命令替换与算术扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"变量与数据类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/shell-scripting/bash-fundamentals/variables-and-types"}}